Audio client ports

The audio session, main/worklet sinks, mixer, unlock prelude, take store,
lane jitter buffer and keep-alive adapt
code from sts2-couch-coop/frontend/src/audio (mainSink.ts, takeStore.ts,
laneJitterBuffer.ts and keepAlive.ts), copyright 2026 Tomás Fox.
The author has relicensed these ports under MIT, the license of this repository.
Product-specific settings, routes and transport DTOs are excluded.

Godot sample playback port

src/audio/sampleEngine.ts and sampleBuses.ts adapt Sample, SampleNode,
SampleNodeBus and Bus from Godot Engine 4.5.1,
platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_audio.js.
